| `CdA`         | Aerodynamic drag area, Cd * A; assumed                         | m2  |   0.6 |
| `T_max`         | Peak wheel torque; 1,400 N.m at the motor times an assumed 8.5:1 reduction                         | N.m  |   12000 |
